OL,3,GNEWSADrivers face 1,250 stops a year at
OL,4,Adamaged bridge
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has made a bid to the
OL,7,Fgovernment for #89.3m to replace the
OL,8,Ftoll bridge and repair Selby bypass
OL,9,Fbridge - nearly triple the original
OL,10,Famount officials said would be needed.
OL,12,FNorth Yorkshire Council's deputy
OL,13,Fleader, Mark Crane, said: "The size of
OL,14,Fthis bid shows just how serious a state
OL,15,Fboth these bridges are in."
